            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku lunaku olusooka olw'omwezi ogwomusanvu mwidha kwesolozanga okunsinza, era mutalukolerangaku mulimo gwonagwona. Ku lunaku olwo mwidha kufuuwanga endeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era mughengayo ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa ekiri n'akawoowo akansangaaza nze Musengwa Katonda, nga kirimu bino: ente ento enume ndala, entaama enume enkulu ndala, n'entaama ento enume musanvu edh'omwaka omulala omulala, nga dhiziraku kikyamu kyonakyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga mughaayo ebyo, mugheerengaku ekigheebwayo ekijiiraku eky'emere ey'empeke kya buwunga obuseereibwa obukalamu nga butabwirwamu omuzigo. Ku nte mugheerengaku kilo isatu, ku ntaama enume mugheerengaku kilo ibiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni ku buli ntaama ku dhire ento omusanvu, kilo ndala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mughengayo embuzi enume ndala ng'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, olw'okutoolebwaku ebibi byaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubighengayo ghalala n'ekigheebwayo ekijiiraku eky'emere ey'empeke n'ekigheebwayo ekijiiraku eky'ebyokunhwa, nga mwongereza ku kigheebwayo ekyokebwa eky'omwezi ogwakaboneka. Akawoowo kaakyo kansangaaza nze Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
